Architectural Design, Artificial Intelligence (AI), Cloud Applications, Cloud Computing, Continuous Deployment/Delivery, Continuous Integration, DevOps, Docker, Finance Software, Functional Programming Languages, Git, Microservices, Microsoft .NET, Microsoft ASP.NET (Active Server Page), Microsoft C# (C Sharp), Microsoft Windows Azure, Platform as a Service (PaaS), Product Support, SQL (Structured Query Language), Software Administration, Software Design, Software Engineering, Software as a Service (SaaS), Stored Procedures, Team Player, Testing


