  Find your future at Revvity.


 
 
  We are looking for a Senior Frontend Software Developer (AI, React, JavaScript) to create secure, performant, cross-platform single page applications and widgets; Collaborate with fellow team members on priorities, specifications, and feature implementation; Craft well-documented, reusable, and testable code; Build and maintain new, high impact functionality into Signals Notebook.


  


  Someone to also demonstrate extensive experience building single page applications with some experience with React/Typescript; Have an eye for design and aesthetics of an application; Have a deep understanding of frontend application structure and architecture.


  


