Skills:
Alliance/Partner Management, Apache Lucene, Artificial Intelligence (AI), Cisco Unity, Clinical Information Systems, Cloud Architecture, Cloud Computing, Computer Science, Develop and Maintain Customers, Distributed Computing, Docker, Embedded Systems, Follow Through, GraphQL, HIPAA (Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act), Healthcare, Internet Application, Licensing, Medical Imaging, Medical Products, Mentoring, Metrics, Problem Solving Skills, Redis, Sales, Scalable System Development, Search Engines, Semiconductors, Software Administration, Software Development, Software Engineering, Stock Purchase Plans, System Operations, Team Player, Training Program, Ultrasound, User Interface/Experience (UI/UX), Web Programming, Willing to Travel


