    'Michael Page', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab3756e759dbced00369e55/images/nHFu55zqhNXynhQZhOE89rabF7qBnYkg5sBFiBBX3ZM.jpeg', 'Remote Senior Backend Engineer - Java - EST USA - Up to $180k', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Work for a global privately owned software organizationWork remotely and earn a great salary with excellent benefits

