) VALUES (
    'Alignerr', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab375706561a6db3635ff3d/images/JMxBzYBy0Gjm6Nkerz34q834Be7eKRX9hW5LjeQB_q4.jpeg', 'Backend Developer - AI Data Services', 'Remote', 'Contractor',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Backend Developer — AI Data Services

About The Role

What if your C# expertise could directly shape the infrastructure powering the world''s most advanced AI systems? We''re looking for a seasoned C# engineer to design and build the data pipelines, annotation tooling, and evaluation systems that leading AI labs depend on to train and improve next-generation models.

This is a fully remote contract role with meaningful, high-impact work on real production systems — not toy projects. If you thrive on complex engineering challenges and want your work to matter at scale, this is the opportunity.

Organization: AlignerrType: Hourly ContractLocation: RemoteCommitment: 20–40 hours/week

What You''ll Do

Design, build, and optimize high-performance C# systems that support AI data pipelines and model evaluation workflowsDevelop full-stack tooling and backend services for large-scale data annotation, validation, and quality controlImprove reliability, performance, and safety across existing C# codebasesCollaborate closely with data, research, and engineering teams to support model training and evaluation pipelinesIdentify bottlenecks and edge cases in data and system behavior — then implement scalable, production-ready fixesParticipate in synchronous design reviews to iterate on architecture and implementation decisions

Who You Are

Native or fluent English speaker with clear written and verbal communication skillsFull-stack developer with a strong systems programming background5+ years of professional experience writing production-grade C#Strong skills in data modeling and database access — ORMs, micro-ORMs, and high-performance SQLExperienced building secure, well-documented endpoints for data access and manipulationAble to commit 20–40 hours per week consistently

Nice to Have

Prior experience with data annotation, data quality systems, or evaluation pipelinesFamiliarity with AI/ML workflows, model training, or benchmarking infrastructureExperience with distributed systems or developer tooling at scale

Why Join Us

Work directly with leading AI research labs on systems that influence next-generation model developmentFully remote — work from wherever you do your best workFlexible contract engagement with a consistent, meaningful workloadCollaborate with a sharp, mission-driven team across data, research, and engineeringPotential for ongoing work and expanded scope as projects grow',
    'active', '2026-09-22T06:51:23.438934+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/backend-developer-ai-data-services-at-alignerr-4470228244', TRUE, ARRAY['Backend Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
