) VALUES (
    'Career Launch', NULL, 'REMOTE Frontend Engineer', 'Remote', 'Contractor',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'ABOUT CAREER LAUNCH
Career Launch is hiring for this role and related opportunities. We review candidate profiles across active roles and use resumes/profiles to understand which backgrounds may be a fit.


THE ROLE
As a REMOTE Frontend Engineer, you may work on projects that require strong execution, communication, analytical judgment, and the ability to move quickly in ambiguous environments.


This posting is intended for candidates who want to be considered for this role type and closely related opportunities.


WHAT YOU MAY WORK ON

Own projects, workflows, research, execution, or stakeholder-facing work related to the role.
Turn messy information into clear next steps, concise updates, and practical recommendations.
Collaborate across product, operations, growth, strategy, technical, or customer-facing teams depending on the role.
Build evidence of your skills through resume/profile context that helps recruiting teams evaluate fit.

WHO THIS IS FOR
This is a strong fit for candidates who are actively exploring new roles and want their resume reviewed for relevant Career Launch opportunities.


HOW TO APPLY
Apply with your resume and the context needed to understand your background. Career Launch may review your profile for this role and related opportunities.',
    'active', '2026-09-23T06:51:23.440008+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://career-launch.careers-page.com/jobs/c372f559-9a56-4515-9fe2-a3930357615c', TRUE, ARRAY['Frontend Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
