    'major scale', 'https://serpapi.com/images/i/iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAADgAAAA4CAMAAACfWMssAAAARVBMVEX-_fn9_Pj_______2ko5_r6ubx8Oz6-fW0s6_g39vW1dGoqKSNjIirq6f19PCcm5fQz8vIx8O7ureTko53dnLBwLxubWoLaJFxAAABPUlEQVRIie1UW3LDIAxECIHBBPzs_Y9aQdIGt-mg-LeWZzD2aFmxC1Lqiiv-XwA_PEJ93z-kSHBlUE4BIpSZnJMCKBwRQniDkJlwjhbQ6H0OixiGOnp9W1caVm0SGE2EghoV7jRHGrR1ZNGb7F021FeIhQjb5j2Wgquk2mwmqR6ySmjIPdxwBelGJ7Ck5NMdX6bVGQKBIfA1PGCP30i2C30V1sfVnQH6cZxOMapg9TkgztlLc6HdVNh1VhJxq_3PNRiosuyW_MjByVrh1WSW-ftsA_EZFJyfmuBNk4dxOG76NY5T0Ob21_QRB-yKU_ZiIzaVYSodRFAq8x1Wvy2pf5cLYzJWNcqmyVf_-4z52Sy4QAr66Oufwa2i5R_NrmUWHlopa7kID-pBQJ64NEiax-9l2I53uvkVV1xxNj4BkTAGmps4yJYAAAAASUVORK5CYII.png', 'Frontend Engineer (React, TypeScript) – NYC/Hybrid or Remote', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
