reputed company Actions, S3/CloudFront static hosting)Experience in hardware, operations, or supply-chain-heavy environments where data is real-time and stakes are highExperience building hardware interfaces — UIs for configuring, monitoring, or controlling physical devices or appliancesFamiliarity with data visualization libraries (D3, Recharts, visx) for surfacing telemetry and operational metricsExposure to build tooling an',
