   Build performant, accessible, and beautiful user interfaces for the Blockchain Council learning platform. You will work with our design team to implement new features and improve the learner experience.


   
    
     Responsibilities
     
      Develop responsive web applications using React and TypeScript
      Implement and maintain our component library and design system
      Optimize application performance and core web vitals
      Write unit and integration tests for critical user flows
      Participate in code reviews and technical architecture discussions
     
    
    
     Requirements
     
