    'YO AI Labs', NULL, 'Frontend Engineer; Remote Architecture, Review & Docs', 'Remote', 'Contractor',
    83000, 124000, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Position: Frontend Engineer (Remote) — Architecture, Review & Docs micro1 is seeking a Frontend Engineer—Technical Reasoning for a remote contractor role. The role focuses on analyzing frontend architecture, explaining technical decisions, and contributing to RFC/ADR documentation.Ideal candidates have strong React and Type Script skills, with a track record in modern frontend architectures, performance optimization, and accessible UI. Excellent communication and writing abilities are required.Consider building your career as a Frontend Engineer (Remote) — Architecture, Review & Docs at YO AI Labs.The Frontend Engineer (Remote) — Architecture, Review & Docs position in the IT & Technology field is open for applications.We have an opening for a Frontend Engineer (Remote) — Architecture, Review & Docs in MD, United States within IT & Technology.This role, Frontend Engineer (Remote) — Architecture, Review & Docs at YO AI Labs, could be your next move.',
    'active', '2026-09-22T06:51:23.440481+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.learn4good.com/jobs/online_remote/software_development/5484680163/e/', TRUE, ARRAY['Frontend Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
