    'YO IT Consulting', NULL, 'Remote Frontend Engineer: Pixel-Perfect UI & Design Systems', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    90000, 120000, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Create high-quality technical documentation and structured examples based on real-world frontend engineering scenarios.Apply your frontend engineering expertise to evaluate UI implementations, styling decisions, and best practices.Interpret component style guides and screenshots to produce accurate technical outputs and documentation.Interpret and translate component style guides and interface screenshots into precise, visually consistent UI deliverables.Implement pixel-perfect, responsive web components using modern technologies such as Typescript and CSS3.Ensure all UI elements adhere to established design systems and accessibility standards.Collaborate asynchronously through clear documentation and constructive feedback within a remote-first environment.Proactively identify, communicate, and resolve inconsistencies or ambiguities in design specifications.Optimize UI performance across devices, focusing on fast load times and smooth interactions.Contribute domain-specific expertise to guide the training and development of advanced AI models.

Job Description

Role Title: Frontend Software Engineer

Role Type: Contract

Location: Remote

Scope Of Work

Create high-quality technical documentation and structured examples based on real-world frontend engineering scenarios.Apply your frontend engineering expertise to evaluate UI implementations, styling decisions, and best practices.Interpret component style guides and screenshots to produce accurate technical outputs and documentation.Interpret and translate component style guides and interface screenshots into precise, visually consistent UI deliverables.Implement pixel-perfect, responsive web components using modern technologies such as Typescript and CSS3.Ensure all UI elements adhere to established design systems and accessibility standards.Collaborate asynchronously through clear documentation and constructive feedback within a remote-first environment.Proactively identify, communicate, and resolve inconsistencies or ambiguities in design specifications.Optimize UI performance across devices, focusing on fast load times and smooth interactions.Contribute domain-specific expertise to guide the training and development of advanced AI models.

Preferred Qualifications

Minimum of 3 years of professional experience delivering high-quality front-end solutions.Proven proficiency with Typescript, CSS3, and responsive web design principles.Demonstrated success in building pixel-perfect interfaces from detailed visual references.Experience working with and extending component style guides and design systems.Strong English communication skillsSelf-motivated and capable of delivering autonomously within distributed project environments.Advanced degree (Master’s or PhD) in Computer Science or a related technical discipline is a plus.',
    'active', '2026-09-17T06:51:23.440503+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.jobleads.com/us/job/remote-frontend-engineer-pixel-perfect-ui-design-systems--washington--e7e290d50accb821a955ed158544183c4', TRUE, ARRAY['Frontend Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
