    120000, 160000, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Note: The job is a remote job and is open to candidates in USA. RE Partners is a fast-growing business and technology consulting company that provides custom-tailored engineering services and supports digital transformation initiatives. The company is seeking a Senior Frontend Engineer (Angular) to build and maintain enterprise-scale web applications, integrate frontend systems with backend services, optimize performance, and support testing and deployment.


