 Deploy and maintain on the cloud
 Interface with Relational databases
 Backend not set up yet. Will involve API figuring out data sources.
 Current team: Team size: 5 -8 people. Proposing an agile team have PO, Designer and backend


Requirements



 Hands on, be a lot of development experience. Scalable dashboard Building resilient and scalable dashboard
 Deploy and maintain on the cloud.
 2 full stack engineers
 UI Development (1st priority)
 Full stack to build the REACT
 Know SQL
 Ability to write and test code.
 AWS React
 Dev Ops (CICD pipeline, GET Hub)
 Lifesciences is good to know. ev
