    'Xlysi LLC.', NULL, 'Full Stack Developer Golang | W2 Only | Remote |', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    72000, 108000, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Job SummaryWe are looking for a Full Stack Developer with strong expertise in Golang to design, build, and maintain scalable web applications.The ideal candidate should have experience working across the backend (Golang, databases, APIs) as well as frontend (React / Angular / Vue) , with a focus on performance, reliability, and clean code.Key ResponsibilitiesDesign, develop, and maintain backend services and APIs using Golang.Build and enhance responsive front-end applications using modern frameworks (React / Angular / Vue).Collaborate with product managers, designers, and other developers to deliver high-quality solutions.Write clean, efficient, and testable code following best practices.Develop and manage RESTful or GraphQL APIs for integration with external systems.Implement secure, scalable, and high-performance applications.Participate in code reviews, troubleshooting, and debugging.Work with CI / CD pipelines and deployment processes in cloud environments (AWS / GCP / Azure).Optimize application performance and ensure system reliability.RequirementsProven experience as a Full Stack Developer with strong backend focus.Must have Experience with Golang (Go)Hands-on experience with frontend frameworks like React.js, Angular, or Vue.js.Strong knowledge of HTML, CSS, JavaScript / TypeScriptExperience with databases (SQL and NoSQL, e.g., PostgreSQL, MongoDB).Familiarity with Docker, Kubernetes, and microservices architectureExperience with RESTful APIs / GraphQL design and implementationKnowledge of Git, CI / CD, and Agile methodologiesStrong problem-solving skills and ability to work in a fast-paced environment.J-18808-Ljbffr.',
    'active', '2026-09-23T06:51:23.441315+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://talents.vaia.com/companies/xlysi-llc/texas-city/full-stack-developer-golang-w2-only-remote-65638682/', TRUE, ARRAY['Full Stack Developer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
