    'RemoteHub', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab375905abea5293e7d4d78/images/dV8F4H1IaNLG8dmZpHqA6sI6bP_XvyEY6vROb9MUxXM.jpeg', '[Remote] Full Stack Developer for Stirling PDF', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Note The job is a remote job and is open to candidates in USA. Stirling PDF is an innovative and rapidly growing startup dedicated to creating self-hosted, open-source PDF editing software. As a full stack developer, you''ll be a crucial part of our fully remote based team, contributing to both front-end and back-end development and helping us revolutionize the open-source software landscape. Responsibilities Develop and maintain full stack applications using Java, Spring Boot, Spring Security, Thymeleaf, HTML, JavaScript, and CSS Collaborate with the team to design and implement various front-end features, ensuring seamless user experiences Engage with the open-source community, contributing to and managing issues on GitHub Implement DevOps practices including Docker and GitHub Actions for continuous integration and deployment Independently handle tasks, from development to QA, ensuring high-quality deliverables Participate in code reviews, provide constructive feedback, and continuously improve code quality Provide customer support for Stirling PDF issues during work hours Skills Proven experience in full stack development, with a strong grasp of Java, Spring Boot, HTML, JavaScript, and CSS Active involvement in open-source projects and communities ideally with Stirling-pdf directly Solid understanding of issue management and version control systems like Git Experience with Docker and GitHub Actions Ability to work independently and manage time effectively in a small team environment Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail Excellent communication skills and a collaborative mindset Knowledge of PDF technologies and libraries Knowledge of React and WASM Experience in startups and Open-Core businesses Benefits Fully remote work environment with a flexible schedule Company Overview Stirling is the private PDF editor. It was founded in 1997, and is headquartered in New York, New York, USA, with a workforce of 2-10 employees. Its website is http//www.stirling.com.',
    'active', '2026-09-22T06:51:23.441500+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://remotehub.p9v.my-board.org/remote-jobs/remote-full-stack-developer-for-stirling-pdf', TRUE, ARRAY['Full Stack Developer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
