    'HireFast', NULL, '[Remote] Senior .NET Full Stack Developer :: Remote :: Hot Requirement', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Note The job is a remote job and is open to candidates in USA. HYR Global Source Inc is seeking a Senior/Lead .NET Full-Stack Developer to design, develop, modernize, and support scalable enterprise applications. The role drives technical solutions across the full software development lifecycle, including architecture, development, testing, deployment, production support, and collaboration in an Agile engineering environment. Responsibilities Design, develop, and maintain high-performance, scalable, secure, and reliable enterprise applications using modern .NET technologies Lead backend development using C#, .NET Core/.NET, ASP.NET Core Web API, Entity Framework Core, LINQ, and RESTful APIs Develop responsive and maintainable front-end applications using React and TypeScript Apply object-oriented programming, SOLID principles, clean code practices, and established design patterns to deliver maintainable solutions Design and optimize Microsoft SQL Server databases, including data modeling, complex queries, stored procedures, indexing, and performance tuning Analyze application and database performance and implement appropriate SQL and application-level optimizations Design and implement secure REST APIs and distributed services following enterprise integration and security best practices Develop cloud-native and cloud-enabled solutions using Microsoft Azure services Participate in application architecture, technical design, code reviews, and engineering best-practice initiatives Troubleshoot complex production and development issues, identify root causes, and implement sustainable solutions Collaborate with product managers, architects, QA engineers, DevOps engineers, and other development teams to deliver high-quality software Contribute to technical documentation, coding standards, development guidelines, and architectural decisions Participate in Agile/Scrum ceremonies, sprint planning, estimation, refinement, reviews, and retrospectives Mentor junior and mid-level developers and provide technical guidance on architecture, coding standards, and development practices Support application deployment, monitoring, troubleshooting, and continuous improvement across development, test, and production environments Skills Any work authorization can apply for these openings Required a Bachelor Degree And Equivalent 12+ years of overall software development experience Deep expertise in C#/.NET, .NET Core, ASP.NET Web API, Entity Framework Core, React, TypeScript, SQL Server, and Microsoft Azure Strong hands-on development capabilities Excellent problem-solving skills The ability to work effectively in an Agile engineering environment Benefits Remote work Company Overview Established in 2013. At HYR Global Source Inc., we are your trusted technology partner, driving innovation through cutting-edge solutions. It was founded in 2013, and is headquartered in Overland Park, Kansas, USA, with a workforce of 51-200 employees. Its website is https//hyrglobalsource.com/. Company H1B Sponsorship HYR Global Source Inc has a track record of offering H1B sponsorships, with 19 in 2026, 34 in 2025, 27 in 2024, 44 in 2023, 46 in 2022, 33 in 2021, 69 in 2020. Please note that this does not guarantee sponsorship for this specific role.',
    'active', '2026-09-19T06:51:23.441598+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://hirefast.g8r.social-networking.me/remote-jobs/remote-senior-net-full-stack-developer-remote-hot-requirement', TRUE, ARRAY['Full Stack Developer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
