    'Upwork', NULL, 'Need new website, full-stack developer specializing in UX/UI design.  Modern Redesign for non-profit', 'Remote', 'Contractor',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Web Designer & Developer Needed – Modern Website Redesign (WordPress)

Full-stack developer specializing in UX/UI design.

Project to be finished within 4-6 weeks from start date.

Summary: We are seeking a talented, creative Web Designer & Developer to completely revamp our existing website into a NEW sleek, professional, and contemporary platform.

The ideal candidate has a strong graphic design background, a sharp modern aesthetic, and deep experience building custom, high-converting layouts using WordPress/Divi/Elementor.

Additionally, we need a seamless, multi-field conference registration flow (with conditional logic and custom selections) and ensuring the site is fully optimized for performance, mobile responsiveness, and search engines.

Key Responsibilities:

•Website Redesign: Modernize our site architecture, visual design, and user experience using WordPress/Divi/Elementor theme/builder.

•	Event/Conference Registration: Set up and integrate a robust registration platform with multi-step fields, custom selections, and secure backend integration and create sturdy CRM.

•	SEO & Performance Optimization: Implement foundational SEO best practices (keyword structure, metadata) and optimize speed and cross-browser compatibility.

Requirements:

•	Proven Design Expertise: Strong graphic design sense, layout mastery, and fluency in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop/Illustrator or Figma).

•	WordPress/Divi/Elementor Mastery: Extensive experience building clean, responsive custom sites.

•	Form & Database Integration: Experience configuring complex form logic and integrating registration platforms with third-party tools/databases.

•	SEO & Technical Standards: Solid grasp of search engine positioning, mobile-first design, and cross-browser compatibility.

To Apply: Please submit your proposal along with 2–3 URLs of WordPress/Divi/Elementor-based websites you have personally designed and developed that highlight your modern layout capabilities and creative style.',
