    'remote quest jobs', NULL, '(Sr.) DevOps Engineer - Fully Remote', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'We are a multinational team that collaborates with Fortune 500 clients!

The DevOps team is within Software Development and Engineering department. This team is responsible for maintaining the software department''s build system and internal service demand. The main responsibility of this position is cooperating with software teams and maintaining the build scripts, improving site reliability, and enforcing good software development practices using infrastructure as code (IAC) methodology.

a) Site reliability/uptime management
b) CI/CD maintenance and automation of CI/CD processes
c) Security monitoring and patching
d) Downtime and patching communication with internal/external stakeholders
e) System upgrades
f) New tool implementation and onboarding
g) Other DevOps related issues included but not limited to above

Requirements:
• Work in an Agile environment to roll out features/fixes/updates in a sprint cycle
• Work with international team to deploy new tools and support existing tools
• Communicate well with internal/external stakeholders to fulfill gather requirements and schedule fixes/downtime
• Work on CI/CD pipelines and support stakeholders with errors running these pipelines
• Pro-actively seeking out irregularities, investigate and report back the findings

Other Requirements:
• AKS, Azure DevOps Pipeline, VM management in Azure.
• Build engineer with experience in reputed company Bamboo or any modern CI/CD toolchain.
• Experience in helm charts.
• Skilled in Python, PowerShell, Go, Bash
• Understands CI/CD concepts and automation of.
• SRE experience: version upgrades, cert upgrades, mitigation of security issues in a cloud infrastructure .
• Worked in an Agile scrum/kanban development model.
• Experience with deployment and use of Artifactory, SonarQube, Bitbucket, Bamboo, Jira, Confluence
• Professional level verbal and written communication skills in English.

Please share your updated resume girish@reputed company

Thanks,

Apply tot his job

