    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Note The job is a remote job and is open to candidates in USA. EPAM Systems is seeking a skilled Data DevOps Engineer to build and maintain robust CI/CD pipelines and drive automation initiatives. The role involves supporting the deployment of scalable, reliable infrastructure across cloud and hybrid environments. Responsibilities Build and maintain CI/CD pipelines for applications, ensuring efficient and reliable deployment processes Automate existing deployment manifests using Infrastructure as Code (IaC) and configuration management tools Integrate GenAI-powered productivity tools, such as Copilot, into daily workflows to enhance automation and efficiency Design, deploy, and manage Windows containers in cloud or hybrid environments Implement verifications and automated tests within deployment pipelines to ensure successful deployments and environment stability Collaborate with engineering teams to identify opportunities for process improvement and automation Skills 3+ years of experience with Azure DevOps, Machine Learning Engineering, and Microsoft Entra ID Proficiency in Python for scripting and automation Experience building and maintaining CI/CD pipelines and deployment processes Skills in Infrastructure as Code (IaC) and configuration management tools Familiarity with Windows container design, deployment, and management in cloud or hybrid environments Understanding of automated testing and verification practices within deployment pipelines Proficiency in English at a B2+ level Experience with SQL databases, SSIS, SSRS, and data warehousing (DWH) solutions Skills in automated Windows OS administration and management Benefits Enjoyable working environment, whether it is the vibrant office or the comfort of your own home Opportunity to work abroad for up to two months per year Relocation opportunities within our offices in 55+ countries Corporate and social events Leadership development, career advising, soft skills and well-being programs Certifications, including GCP, Azure and AWS Unlimited access to EPAM''s internal learning database Free English classes with certified teachers Discounts in local language schools, including offline courses for the Uzbek language Monetary bonuses for engaging in the referral program Medical & family care package Four trust days per year (sick leave without a medical certificate) Discounts for fitness clubs, dance schools and sports programs Benefits package (sports activities, a variety of stores and services) Company Overview EPAM leverages its core engineering expertise as a leading global product development and digital platform engineering services company. It was founded in 1993, and is headquartered in Newtown, Pennsylvania, USA, with a workforce of 10001+ employees. Its website is https//www.epam.com. Company H1B Sponsorship EPAM Systems has a track record of offering H1B sponsorships, with 34 in 2026, 120 in 2025, 172 in 2024, 232 in 2023, 373 in 2022, 359 in 2021, 502 in 2020. Please note that this does not guarantee sponsorship for this specific role.',
