We are hiring a Senior DevOps Engineer who will be responsible for the entire lifecycle of Continuous Integration/Continuous Deployment pipelines and Infrastructure as Code approaches. This role involves defining and managing automated configuration management, release management, build, test, and deployment activities. The engineer will also provide prototypes and concepts for further automation of assigned technology. This position is part of an International Team working on a greenfield software project for Deutsche Telekom Group, impacting millions of customers by supporting the request and installation tracking of Fiber network services. The product is a set of applications and websites designed to support end-to-end processes including Fiber pre-ordering, ordering, installation, service management, and customer support.

