Qualifications:	 US Citizenship required	 8+ years of DevSecOps experience, including experience as a senior team resource	 4+ years of AWS Cloud management experience, preferably commercial and GovCloud	 Extensive experience with NIST security best practices ang the DoD SRG.	 Ability to architect solutions to complex problems using industry-standard open-source frameworks	 Experience working on a large enterprise platform with thousands of users	 Experience scaling software platforms from limited specialty use to broad user adoption	 Code versioning with Git with ability to interactively rebase	 Ability to test and review the code of your peers
Compensation & Benefits:Salary Range: $120,000 – $160,000 annuallyBenefits Include:Health insurancePaid time offFlexible work scheduleParental leaveProfessional development supportWork-from-home flexibility

Remote

