    'Focus Group Panel', NULL, 'Paid Focus Group Participant - Remote (Work From Home)', 'Remote', 'Part-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Your opinion is worth money — and real companies will pay for it. Focus Group Panel connects everyday people across the U.S. with paid market research: remote focus groups, product tests, and online surveys from brands you already know. Active members earn up to $790 a week, depending on the studies they qualify for. No experience, no selling, no fees — just your honest feedback.


      Topics we need opinions on: food & dining, cell phones, streaming & entertainment, electronics, pets, automobiles, and family products.


      What you''ll do: join short remote sessions, surveys, and product tests — pick the ones that interest you and share honest feedback.


      What you need: a phone, tablet, or computer with a camera and reliable internet. No degree, no résumé, no experience.


      Why Focus Group Panel: real studies with real brands — not a "get rich" gimmick. Your info stays private, and you choose what you join. Part-time or full-time, on your schedule.


      Pay: up to $790/week, varies by study. Spots are limited — check your eligibility today.


      Compensation varies by study and assignment; not all applicants will qualify. Full terms shown on the application form.

