) VALUES (
    'Review Pays', NULL, 'Entry-Level Application QA Specialist - Home-Based / iOS', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'How often do mobile apps and games enhance your daily routine, turning mundane tasks into engaging experiences? As an Entry-Level Application QA Specialist, you''ll play a crucial role in shaping these digital tools. Your mission will involve meticulously testing apps and games on iOS devices, ensuring every feature works seamlessly and delivers a delightful user experience. You''ll uncover and report bugs, collaborate with developers, and help refine products before they reach eager consumers. If you''re passionate about technology and ready to dive into the dynamic world of app testing, this is the perfect opportunity to start your journey. Roles: In this role, you will explore and test mobile apps directly on your smartphone or tablet. Your task is to navigate their main features, observe how smoothly they perform, and share brief, genuine feedback on the overall experience, including usability and areas for improvement. Contract length: No fixed term — participate whenever it suits your schedule. Rate: $35 per hour. What you''ll need: A smartphone or tablet with dependable internet access. You should be comfortable installing apps, following straightforward steps, and managing your own time. A commitment of at least 5 hours per week is recommended. No prior experience is required — ideal for detail‐oriented beginners eager to contribute to app testing. Location: Remote work worldwide (United States preferred). This flexible role offers a simple way to start working remotely. You''ll help enhance mobile app quality by providing honest, hands‐on feedback — no meetings, strict deadlines, or technical barriers. Just practical testing you can do from anywhere, at your own pace. If you''re ready to begin, apply today and turn your app testing into meaningful insights that help shape better digital experiences. Apply Now #J-18808-Ljbffr',
    'active', '2026-09-23T06:51:23.443855+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://talents.vaia.com/companies/review-pays/entry-level-application-qa-specialist-home-based-ios-113388851/', TRUE, ARRAY['Site Reliability Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
