    status, posted_at, external_id, source, url, is_remote, tags
) VALUES (
    'NEOGOV', NULL, 'Senior Cloud Engineer', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'This is a remote role from anywhere in the US

For over 25 years, NEOGOV has been at the forefront of public-sector innovation, building technology that helps government and education organizations work smarter, move faster, and better serve their communities.

We are a team of cutting-edge technologists, operators, and problem-solvers with top-tier skills and a shared ambition: to build the most efficient operating model in GovTech. We combine deep public-sector expertise with modern SaaS practices, AI-enabled workflows, and a relentless focus on execution.


At our core, we are a people-first company. We empower our customers to support the public servants they employ, the communities they serve, and the talented teams that bring our platform to life.

Our solutions support the entire employee journey, from hire to retire. By transforming complex HR and compliance workflows into simple, intuitive experiences, we help public-sector organizations reduce friction, improve efficiency, and focus on what matters most: making a difference.


This posting is for an existing vacancy.


We’re looking for a Sr. AWS Cloud Engineer to join our team and work closely with the product owner and team of other software engineers to ensure that the SaaS product we’re delivering meets our industry-leading standards of quality.

Work as a software engineer developing, delivering, and maintaining features such as Infrastructure as Code (IaC), our build and release platform, or customer-facing features. Design and deploy scalable, highly available, secure, and fault-tolerant systems. Maintain and ensure compliance in a high-performance production environment. Deliver your work in a reliable and maintainable manner by writing clean, testable code. Actively participate in planning work for the team and identify ways to improve team velocity and quality. Maintain, test, and implement disaster recovery procedures. Perform infrastructure upgrades and updates to maximize system efficiency while minimizing downtime.


Strong problem solver with excellent communication skills

Empathetic and have a growth mindset with a desire to learn and embrace challenges

Able to learn new technologies quickly and independently

Innovative and passionate about your work


What You Have


A desire to work in an operations environment that aspires to DevOps and SRE principles.

Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, a related field, or equivalent professional work experience.

Must-Have Requirements:

Expertise in AWS CDK: Deep, hands-on experience using the AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) to define infrastructure using modern programming languages.

7+ years of experience in cloud engineering with a focus on AWS services, including CloudFormation, Auto Scaling, ECS, and Serverless architectures.

Software development experience with TypeScript, C#, or Java (essential for CDK implementation).

Nice-to-Have:

Strong Cloud fundamentals with an emphasis on AWS Well-Architected best practices.

Experience with CI/CD pipelines, Jenkins, MSBuild, and Git.

Experience working in a “compliant” environment (e.g., CJIS, FedRAMP, or SOC2).

Comprehensive Benefits package (medical, dental, vision, etc.) for full-time employees

Generous PTO to support work-life balance

Remote working opportunities

401K Matching

Autonomy to grow and find your career path with supportive leadership

12-week Paid Parental LeaveInclusive and diverse environment


NEOGOV does not discriminate in employment on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy and gender identity), national origin, political affiliation, sexual orientation, marital status, disability, genetic information, age, membership in an employee organization, retaliation, parental status, military service, or other non-merit factors.


#LI-REMOTE ',
    'active', '2026-09-08T06:51:23.443927+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.governmentjobs.com/jobs/5412817-0/senior-cloud-engineer', TRUE, ARRAY['Cloud Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
