    'Smart Working', NULL, 'Cloud Engineer - Frontend-leaning (Remote, Full-Time) [AS315]', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'About Smart Working

At Smart Working, we believe your job should not only look right on paper but also feel right every day. This isn’t just another remote opportunity - it’s about finding where you truly belong, no matter where you are. From day one, you’re welcomed into a genuine community that values your growth and well-being.

Our mission is simple: to break down geographic barriers and connect skilled professionals with outstanding global teams and products for full-time, long-term roles. We help you discover meaningful work with teams that invest in your success, where you’re empowered to grow personally and professionally.

Join one of the highest-rated workplaces on Glassdoor and experience what it means to thrive in a truly remote-first world.

About the Role

As a Cloud Engineer (Frontend-Leaning), you will focus on building and maintaining dashboards and admin consoles while supporting the cloud infrastructure required to host and deliver frontend applications. This is an ongoing, long-term opportunity.

You will work primarily with React and AWS, implementing CI/CD and deployment pipelines for frontend applications and using core AWS services to support frontend hosting and delivery. The role is frontend-leaning, with a proposed split of roughly 70% frontend and 30% backend.

Responsibilities
- Build and maintain dashboards and admin consoles using React.

- Implement CI/CD and deployment pipelines for frontend applications on AWS.

- Work with core AWS services to support frontend hosting and delivery.

Requirements
- 5+ years of experience with AWS.

- 3+ years of experience building dashboards and/or admin consoles.

- 2+ years of experience with CI/CD and deployment for frontend applications on AWS, or general CI/CD experience using GitHub Actions or GitLab CI with willingness to pick up AWS-specific deployment.

- 3+ years of experience with React, or equivalent experience with Vue or Angular.',
    'active', '2026-08-24T06:51:23.443975+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://remotejobs.org/remote-jobs/cloud-engineer-frontend-leaning-remote-full-time-as315-smart-working', TRUE, ARRAY['Cloud Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
