  Architecting and implementing security best practices for GCP solutions using products such as Assured Workloads, Cloud Logging, Cloud Monitoring, and Security Command Center.
  Staying up-to-date on the latest GCP services and technologies and their applicability to the Public Sector space.
 
 Mid Level Required Qualifications:


 
