Amazon Web Services (AWS), Application Hosting, Authentication, Best Practices, Business Analysis, Cloud Applications, Cloud Computing, Computer Security, Consulting, Cryptography, Distributed Applications, Documentation, Embedded Systems, Emerging Technology, Firewalls, Identify Issues, Information Technology & Information Systems, Microsoft .NET, Microsoft Windows Azure, Network Architecture/Engineering, Performance Analysis, Product Lifecycle, Public Key Infrastructure (PKI), Requirements Management, Smartcards, Software Engineering, TCP/IP (Transmission Control Protocol/Internet Protocol), VPN (Virtual Private Network)


