    'All IT Solutions', NULL, 'DevOps/Cloud Engineer - Senior', 'Remote', 'Contractor',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'DevOps/Cloud Engineer - Senior


 All IT Solutions


 Canada · Ontario, Ontario


 Workplace Type — Remote


 Employment Type — Contract


 We are currently seeking a qualified DevOps/Cloud Engineer - Senior to support this engagement. Please review the complete requirements, work location, employment type, and screening questions before applying. Candidates whose experience closely matches the position will be contacted directly by the AIS recruiting team.


 Job Summary


 All IT Solutions is seeking a DevOps/Cloud Engineer - Senior to join a client engagement.


 Required Qualifications


 
  2 days/week Public Sector Experience: MUST HAVE
  Strong hands-on experience designing, maintaining, and troubleshooting CI/CD pipelines using GitHub Actions and Strong infrastructure-as-code experience using AWS CloudFormation and AWS CDK, including development and maintenance of CDK solutions in Python and JavaScript
  Experience building and maintaining Linux machine images and automated image pipelines using AWS EC2 Image Builder and Experience administering and supporting PostgreSQL or comparable enterprise database platforms, including connectivity, access, backup and recovery, performance, and operational troubleshooting and Experience administering and troubleshooting Amazon OpenSearch Service clusters, including cluster health, indexes, capacity, access, performance, and operational issues
  Experience deploying, configuring, maintaining, and troubleshooting Mirth Connect integration engine in Amazon ECS, including container and task configuration, Mirth channels and connectors, secure endpoints, certificates and secrets, logging, JVM/runtime issues, and connectivity to external systems
  Experience maintaining enterprise identity and access management and SMART on FHIR/OAuth configurations using NetIQ or comparable IAM platforms, including OAuth2/OIDC clients, redirect URIs, scopes, authorization and token endpoint settings, roles, permissions, secrets, and authentication troubleshooting
  Experience supporting secure connectivity and integration endpoints between cloud applications and external healthcare systems, including eReferral platforms and enterprise master data management services and Experience using AWS monitoring, logging, security, and configuration services such as CloudWatch, IAM, Secrets Manager, and related operational tooling and Strong production support, incident troubleshooting, technical documentation, change management, and stakeholder collaboration skills
 
 ABOUT ALL IT SOLUTIONS LLC


 Headquartered in Mount Laurel, New Jersey, All IT Solutions LLC is a technology and workforce solutions company serving government and commercial organizations throughout the United States. AIS provides IT staffing and staff augmentation, cybersecurity, IT consulting, custom software development, cloud services, data engineering, artificial intelligence, application development, and related technology solutions.


 AIS is an NMSDC/EMSDC-certified Minority Business Enterprise and an NYC Department of Small Business Services-certified M/WBE. We participate in E-Verify and are committed to maintaining professional, transparent, and compliant hiring practices.


 EQUAL EMPLOYMENT OPPORTUNITY


 All IT Solutions LLC is an equal opportunity employer. Employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, performance, and legitimate business requirements without regard to race, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.


 Reasonable accommodations are available to qualified applicants with disabilities during the application and interview process.


 RECRUITMENT NOTICE


 All IT Solutions LLC is a staffing and technology services company and may receive fees or compensation from client organizations for recruiting, staffing, placement, or workforce services. Candidates are never charged an application, recruitment, placement, or interview fee by All IT Solutions LLC.


 Any commercial rates, fees, or staffing arrangements are between All IT Solutions LLC and its clients and do not require payment from the candidate.


 Official recruiting communications will come from an authorized All IT Solutions representative or an @allitsolutions.us email address.


 Apply


