    130000, 150000, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Senior Systems Engineer - 100% Remote FTE (Azure, Windows, Monitoring)




Optomi, in partnership with an industry leader is looking an experienced Senior System Engineer to join their team on a full-time, remote basis. This will be a first shift ideally EST working hours role. This engineer will design implement hybrid and cloud infrastructure solutions in Azure to support applications operations. They will focus on system performance, scaling, and reliability.




Responsibilities:

Windows administration to configure, manage, deploy and upgrade serversUtilizing Windows IIS for web services and applications hosted on Windows serversCompleting cloud projects in Azure using various web services such as Azure Monitor, Function Apps, Azure Site Recovery, Front Door, etc. as well as NSG''s, ASG''s, VNets, Entra ID, etc.Collaborate with Database and SRE team members ensure smooth operation and integration of systemsTroubleshooting of various infrastructure including Systems, networking, virtualization and cloud issuesAutomate various parts of the environment with various languages including PowerShell, Terraform, Ansible, etc.Monitoring the environment using tools such as Data Dog (configuration, reviewing dashboardsResearch of emerging trends on various technology, tools and AI


Apply today if your background includes:

Windows server/administration and IIS background- upgrades, web services, managementAzure cloud engineering experience- migrations, upgrades etc with tools such as Azure Monitor, Logic Apps, Azure Site Recovery, Front Door, Key VaultMonitoring experience using various tools such as Data Dog, App Dynamics, Solar Winds, Dynatrace, etc- configuration, reporting, vulnerabilities, dashboardsSystem and network troubleshooting experience- virtualization, DNS, DHCP, AD, etc.Some automation experience utilizing a Python, PowerShell, Terraform, or AnsibleExperience working on a small but lean team involved in both operations and projectsExperience communication with various engineering teams (SRE, DevOps, Release, Database) to ensure smooth project completion and integrationUnderstanding of DevOps and SRE principles',
    'active', '2026-09-11T06:51:23.444300+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/senior-systems-engineer-windows-azure-monitoring-fte-100%25-remote-at-optomi-4465110656', TRUE, ARRAY['Cloud Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
