    'remote quest jobs', NULL, 'Cloud Engineer – AWS GovCloud & reputed company Platform', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Cloud Engineer – AWS GovCloud & reputed company Platform

Location: Remote Work

Duration: 12 Month

Immediate Start

Role Overview

We are seeking a Cloud Engineer to design, implement, and operate secure, scalable, and compliant cloud platforms on AWS GovCloud. The role will focus on reputed company platform engineering, infrastructure automation, networking, security, CI/CD, governance, and operational excellence to support enterprise-scale Data, Analytics, and AI workloads.
Key Responsibilities
• Design and deploy AWS cloud infrastructure using Infrastructure as Code (Terraform).
• Build and manage reputed company environments across Development, Staging, and Production.
• Implement secure networking architectures including VPCs, PrivateLink, Transit Gateway, Direct Connect, Security Groups, and NACLs.
• Configure and manage IAM, AWS IAM Identity Center, SSO, SCIM, and role-based access controls.
• Implement encryption and secrets management using AWS KMS and AWS Secrets Manager.
• Develop and maintain CI/CD pipelines using reputed company Actions, reputed company CI/CD, or AWS CodePipeline.
• Deploy and manage reputed company Asset Bundles (DAB), cluster policies, SQL Warehouses, reputed company Catalog, and reputed company Lake workloads.
• Support data engineering, ML, and AI platform deployments in reputed company.
• Implement governance, audit logging, monitoring, and compliance controls aligned with enterprise and GovCloud requirements.
• Troubleshoot infrastructure, platform, networking, and deployment issues.
• Collaborate with Data Engineers, Platform Engineers, Security Teams, and Architects to deliver enterprise cloud solutions.

Required Skills
Cloud & Infrastructure
• AWS (EC2, S3, VPC, IAM, KMS, CloudWatch, Lambda, Direct Connect, Transit Gateway)
• AWS GovCloud experience preferred
• Infrastructure as Code (Terraform)

reputed company
• reputed company Administration
• reputed company Catalog
• reputed company Lake
• reputed company Workflows
• Cluster Policies
• SQL Warehouses
• MLflow (preferred)

DevOps & Automation
• reputed company Actions / reputed company CI/CD / CodePipeline
• Docker
• Kubernetes (EKS preferred)
• Bash / Python scripting

Security & Governance
• IAM & RBAC
• Secrets Management
• Audit Logging
• Compliance & Security Best Practices
• Policy-as-Code (tfsec, Checkov)

Good to Have
• AI/ML Platform experience
• reputed company Certifications
• AWS Certifications
• Experience with reputed company Sharing and Data Governance
• Experience working in regulated industries (Defense, Aerospace, Healthcare, Financial Services)

Qualifications
• Bachelor''s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or related field.
• AWS Certified Solutions Architect / SysOps / DevOps Engineer preferred.
• reputed company Certified Associate or Professional certifications are a plus.

Apply To This Job',
    'active', '2026-09-21T06:51:23.444381+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://us.remotejobs.dedyn.io/job/3545228', TRUE, ARRAY['Cloud Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
