    'RemoteHub', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab3765c95a694b5e1281175/images/nvEs9QiLxSbdhwQ9cRkLMMhMuFwqrAUOeG8yJ4h9YrE.jpeg', '[Remote] Cloud Engineer II', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Note The job is a remote job and is open to candidates in USA. First Citizens Bank is a financial services company seeking a Cloud Engineer II to support its enterprise Internal Developer Platform. The role engineers, integrates, automates, and supports platform capabilities including self-service tools, service catalogs, templates, golden paths, automation workflows, and developer experience solutions. Responsibilities Platform Development (35%) Platform Integrations (25%) Automation Engineering (20%) Platform Adoption (10%) Operational Excellence (10%) Skills Bachelor''s Degree and 2 years of experience in OR High School Diploma or GED and 6 years of experience in * IDP, Service Catalogs * Golden Paths, Platform Automation * IaC * GitOps * CI/CD * API Integration * Container Platforms * Cloud Platforms * Scripting * Policy-as-Code * Observability * Kubernetes * AI-assisted engineering tools Benefits Remote work arrangement Company Overview First Citizens Wealth offers a full range of financial planning, asset management, private banking, brokerage, investment advisory, insurance and trust services to individuals and institutional clients. It was founded in 1898, and is headquartered in Raleigh, North Carolina, USA, with a workforce of 51-200 employees. Its website is http//www.firstcitizens.com.',
