Join one of the highest-rated workplaces on Glassdoor and experience what it means to thrive in a truly remote-first world.


About the Role
As a Senior Cloud Engineer - AWS (Backend / DevOps-leaning), you will take responsibility for designing, building and maintaining AWS infrastructure using Terraform and Infrastructure as Code. This is an ongoing, long-term opportunity focused on reliable cloud infrastructure and its supporting delivery processes.


You will manage EC2 and other core infrastructure components, support CI/CD pipelines for infrastructure changes, and implement and maintain security and compliance controls.


Responsibilities
Design, build and maintain AWS infrastructure using Terraform and Infrastructure as Code.
Manage EC2 and core infrastructure components.
