3+ years of Terraform / Infrastructure as Code experience, with CI/CD pipeline experience as an inherent part of this skill.
2+ years of experience managing EC2 and core infrastructure.
1+ years of security compliance experience with ISO27001 or a similar standard.
Nice to HaveSOC2 or GDPR compliance exposure, or strong general security best-practice experience as an alternative to ISO27001 or similar security compliance experience.Originally posted on Himalayas



 

