    'Archipelago Companies', NULL, 'OluKai, melin, Roark (Tradewind Services) Lead Data Engineer', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    160000, 198000, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'About the position

Tradewind Services provides shared services across Archipelago Companies'' portfolio of brands (OluKai, Melin, Roark) and international subsidiaries (Arch-UK, Arch-EU). We''re hiring a Lead Data Engineer to own our data infrastructure end to end: building the pipelines that bring data in from across the business, running our Snowflake environment, and becoming the go-to expert on how our data fits together. This is a senior, high-ownership role. You''ll be the person who can stand up a data warehouse from scratch and the person other teams come to when they need to know where a number comes from.

Responsibilities

Design, build, and maintain ETL/ELT pipelines that bring data into Snowflake from across the business: Shopify, Google Ads, Google Analytics, Google BigQuery, ERP flat-file exports, transactional databases, and internal documents (Google Docs, Excel)Own and administer the Snowflake environment: architecture, performance tuning, cost and credit management, security, and access controls. Code lives in GitHub, version-controlled and structured for easy AI-assisted development and iterationStand up new Snowflake instances and environments as the organization''s data needs growBuild and maintain data models that support reporting and analysis across brands (OluKai, Melin, Roark) and subsidiariesEstablish data quality, testing, and monitoring practices so pipeline failures and data issues get caught before stakeholders find themPartner with teams across marketing, ecom, wholesale, and finance to understand data needs and translate them into reliable pipelines and modelsOwn data governance: naming conventions, access control, and documentation of sources and transformationsServe as the organization''s subject-matter expert on data architecture and lineageRequirements

Bachelor’s degree required5+ years of senior level data engineering experience, with a track record of owning a data platform end to endDeep, hands-on Snowflake experience: warehouse architecture, performance and cost optimization, RBAC, Snowpipe, Streams/TasksProven experience building ETL/ELT pipelines from a range of source types: ad platforms (e.g., Google Ads), analytics/tracking tools (e.g., Google Analytics), ERPs, relational databases, and spreadsheet-based sources (e.g., Google Sheets)Strong SQL and hands-on experience building ETL/ELT pipelines from scratchPython for scripting, pipeline orchestration, and custom integrationsExperience designing data warehouse models (e.g., dimensional/star schema) for reporting and analytics use casesStrong communication skills; comfortable being the source of truth other teams rely onNice-to-haves

Experience with Domo or a similar BI/reporting platformExperience with retail or consumer products data (wholesale, DTC/ecom, inventory)Experience with orchestration tools (e.g., Airflow, dbt Cloud, Prefect)Experience consolidating data across multiple brands, business units, or entitiesBenefits

Opportunity for annual bonus',
    'active', '2026-08-31T06:51:23.445422+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.tealhq.com/job/lead-data-engineer_7ea1abc0fb221f8ed1fcff8173110bf393d0d', TRUE, ARRAY['Data Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
