    'Central Business Solutions', NULL, 'Databricks Data Engineer (Databricks, PySpark, Cloud, MLOps) | 100% Remote | Contract 12 + Months | SSwar', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'About the position

We are seeking a highly experienced Databricks Data Engineer for a 100% remote, contract position lasting 12+ months. The role involves working on data engineering, data platforms, and analytics, with a strong emphasis on Databricks, PySpark, Cloud technologies, and MLOps. The ideal candidate will have extensive consulting experience and a proven track record of delivering complex data projects.

Responsibilities

Develop and implement data engineering solutions on the Databricks platform.Design and build scalable data pipelines using PySpark.Leverage cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP) for data solutions.Apply MLOps principles to production deployments.Optimize data processing for performance and scalability.Utilize CI/CD practices for production deployments.Stay current with Databricks product and platform features.Requirements

10+ years of experience in data engineering, data platforms, and analytics.10+ years of consulting experience.Completed Data Engineering Professional certification and required classes.Minimum of 6-8+ projects delivered with hands-on development experience on Databricks.Working knowledge of two or more common Cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP) with deep expertise in at least one.Deep experience with distributed computing with Spark, including knowledge of Spark runtime internals.Familiarity with CI/CD for production deployments.Working knowledge of MLOps.Current knowledge across the breadth of Databricks product and platform features.Familiarity with optimizations for performance and scalability.',
    'active', '2026-09-21T06:51:23.445477+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.tealhq.com/job/databricks-data-engineer_7ea1a259e7e872a6caf001016b6cdb64bb2b0', TRUE, ARRAY['Data Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
