    'Samprasoft', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab37673bd1c2092984922d0/images/3tL5ASaImcE5lO45jLKeNEtfH4hZ2fzCvI3ItRL4DyM.jpeg', 'Principal Data Engineer (Azure, Databricks, Big Data) | TELECOMMUTE', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Job Title 100% telecommute. Potential for very limited travel. 

Work hours: 8-4 PST 

Interview Process: 2 rounds. 1st being of a technical nature and the second will be geared towards work practice and general work experience and scenario based questions. 

