 Create and maintain data jobs in Azure cloud environment, CI/CD pipelines for azure development and deployment, Databricks delta tables, live tables, and general databricks infrastructure. Build data pipelines for production pharmacy data to cloud according to business need. Develop CI/CD pipelines and maintain for application development and production readiness. Build medallion layered datasets in databricks and maintain for use in operation applications.  Ideal Background: Cloud engineering with Azure experience, experience with datafactory, databricks, and overall cloud infrastructure and security. 

Required: 

 At least 5 years of data engineering in Azure cloud. Experience building and maintaining pipelines in datafactory. Experience building CI/CD strategy utilizing Jenkins, GIT, Terraform. 5 years of experience working with big data warehouse solutions in the cloud. Hadoop/Hive, Synapse, Databricks. 3 Years’ experience specifically with Databricks.',
