    'InstantServe LLC', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab376771de06477ef4ec2bd/images/pHXh6vzTsB_IIbeQSeTsNyFp1hM0KJGPJRKxiV3mgFc.jpeg', 'Budget Analyst – Mid Level', 'Remote', 'Contractor',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Now Hiring: Budget Analyst – Mid Level 

Location: Raleigh, NC – Onsite

Contract: 12 Months

Interview: Webcam




We are looking for an experienced Budget Analyst / Budget Operations & Contract Monitoring Analyst to support budget operations, financial reporting, contract monitoring, and fund utilization activities.




Key Responsibilities

• Prepare, review, and process journal vouchers across state and federal funding sources.

• Monitor contract spend against authorized budgets and prepare utilization, variance, and projected-spend reports.

• Track fund utilization across state and federal funding sources.

• Prepare and process budget revisions with appropriate documentation and audit trails.

• Support financial reconciliation and respond to budget/contract-related questions.

• Manage multiple priorities while maintaining accuracy and meeting recurring deadlines.

• Prepare clear financial reports and communicate findings to program and finance teams.




Required Qualifications

• 3+ years of experience in budget analysis, accounting, or financial reporting.

• 3+ years monitoring contract spend across multiple contracts.

• 3+ years tracking fund utilization across state and federal sources.

• Experience managing multiple priorities/projects simultaneously.

• Strong written and verbal communication skills.

• Proficiency with Microsoft Project Suite, MS Teams, Zoom, spreadsheets, and financial systems.

• Strong attention to detail and ability to manage a high volume of financial transactions.




Highly Desired

• 3+ years of State Government/Public Sector experience, particularly with Health & Human Services programs.

• Experience with Medicaid / Medicaid Management Information System (MMIS) or similar healthcare government programs.

• Experience with government fund accounting and budget revision processes.




📩 Interested candidates: Please send your updated resume to berry.j@iserveworld.com',
