INSERT INTO jobs (
    company_name, company_logo_url, position_title, location, employment_type,
    salary_min, salary_max, salary_currency, salary_period, description,
    status, posted_at, external_id, source, url, is_remote, tags
) VALUES (
    'Revelation Gold Group', NULL, 'Web Design Intern', 'Remote', 'Internship',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'About Revelation Gold Group


Revelation Gold Group is a premier Gold IRA firm dedicated to helping clients protect their wealth and secure their financial legacy. Our mission is to deliver peace of mind through honest service and real assets, like physical gold and silver. Rooted in the core values of faith, family, and financial freedom, we pride ourselves on building lifelong trust with our clients.


About the Role


We''re looking for a motivated Web Design Intern to help us rebuild our entire website from the ground up. This is not a maintenance role. You''ll be working directly alongside our team on a full redesign, including new page layouts, backgrounds and visual direction, a CMS for our content, a database behind it, and fresh hosting for the finished site.


Because our audience is primarily an older demographic, all web designs must be minimalist, clear, and highly intuitive, with a strong focus on trust, readability, and simplicity. The core focus of this role is exceptional design judgment. We build and ship using AI tools, designing with Claude and building and hosting on Lovable, so you''ll get to spend your time on the design thinking instead of fighting a page builder. No prior experience with these tools is required, only curiosity and a willingness to learn them fast.


Expect a tight feedback loop. You''ll design, we''ll review it together, and we''ll push it live.


Responsibilities



 Design clean, highly visual web layouts and digital assets for the new site.
 Translate design concepts into working pages using Claude and Lovable.
 Help structure the CMS and content so pages are easy to update over time.
 Review designs with the team, iterate on feedback, and ship to production.
 Maintain consistent, highly professional branding across all digital touchpoints.
 Collaborate closely with the marketing team on new pages and campaign landing pages.

Requirements



 A strong passion for web design, user experience, and digital layouts.
 A portfolio demonstrating your skills. School, personal, or conceptual projects are accepted.
 Comfort with modern design tools such as Figma, and an interest in AI assisted building.
 Basic understanding of how websites are structured, including pages, content, and navigation.
 Strong attention to detail and an eagerness to learn.

What You''ll Gain



 Hands-on experience with a recognized company in the financial space.
 A complete website redesign in your portfolio, published on a real, high-visibility site.
 Direct mentorship from experienced professionals, plus practical skills in the AI build stack that is reshaping web development.
 Weekly team lunches and a highly collaborative, supportive environment.
 Strong CV experience to boost your future career opportunities.

Job Type: Part-time, Internship
Work Location: Remote


Expected hours: 15.0 per week


Application Question(s):



 We design with Claude and build and host on Lovable. Are you willing to learn and work in these AI tools day to day?

Work Location: Remote',
    'active', '2026-09-01T06:51:23.447145+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=30c7f6de9cd61a6a', TRUE, ARRAY['Data Analyst','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
