INSERT INTO jobs (
    company_name, company_logo_url, position_title, location, employment_type,
    salary_min, salary_max, salary_currency, salary_period, description,
    status, posted_at, external_id, source, url, is_remote, tags
) VALUES (
    'Doctronic Inc', NULL, 'Vertical Sales Lead, Ecosystem Partners', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    225000, 275000, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'The Role

You will own the ecosystem vertical: the companies that embed Doctronic inside their own product rather than buying it for a member population. Digital health platforms, retail pharmacy, pharma, wearable and device companies, and employer and broker platforms.

These are the deals that matter most to our long-term margin, because they are sold as software. Our goal is for half of enterprise revenue to come from technology-only deals, and this role owns most of that number. It means selling to product and engineering leaders as often as commercial ones, and structuring partnerships that do not look like a standard SaaS contract. You will report to the Chief Business Officer.

What You''ll Do
Own pipeline generation and closed contract value across the ecosystem vertical, with a target of at least four opportunities in contracting or later at any timeLead with our technology products: the medical API skill that runs inside a partner''s own orchestrator, and the embedded chat experienceSell to technical and product buyers, which means holding a credible conversation about APIs, orchestration, latency, data flow and clinical guardrailsStructure non-standard commercial arrangements: revenue share, per-interaction, per-member, referral pathways and co-development termsDeliberately bias the deal mix toward technology-only structures, and track offering mix on every deal so we can see whether we are actually moving that wayWork closely with our Enterprise Product Lead on what is productizable, and decline the asks that would turn us into a development shopRun co-marketing and launch moments with B2B marketing, since ecosystem partners are how we reach patients at scaleBuild the referral and land-and-expand motion inside partners who start smallWhat We''re Looking For
8+ years in enterprise sales, business development or partnerships at a digital health, health technology or platform companyHas closed embedded, API-style partnerships, not only reseller or referral agreementsTechnically conversant. You do not need to write code, but you need to earn the respect of the engineers on both sides of the tableComfort designing commercial structures from scratch, and the discipline to keep them simple enough to actually operateA network across some meaningful slice of the ecosystem: digital health platforms, retail health, pharma direct-to-patient, or connected devicesHas carried a number rather than only sourced pipelineWillingness to travel heavily. Based in New York City or willing to relocate. This is a hybrid roleNice to Have
Platform, marketplace or developer ecosystem experience, where your product was a component inside someone else''sPharma direct-to-patient experience, given how quickly LillyDirect, PfizerForAll and their peers are reshaping that channelRetail pharmacy or retail health partnershipsWearables, remote monitoring or connected device integrationsExperience launching a partner API program or self-service developer portalCompensation & Benefits
Base salary range: $225-$275k + commission of up to 50% of baseVariable compensation and OTE splitMeaningful equityHealth reimbursement allowance, support for well-being, and flexible time off',
    'active', '2026-09-21T06:51:23.447216+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.theladders.com/job/vertical-sales-lead-ecosystem-partners-doctronic-inc-virtual-travel_88956948', TRUE, ARRAY['Data Analyst','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
