Remote

Skills:
Analysis Skills, Artificial Intelligence (AI), Brownfield Redevelopment, Business Processes, Cloud Computing, Computer Science, Consulting, Data Analysis, Data Migration, Data Processing, Data Quality, Data Structures, Database Extract Transform and Load (ETL), Documentation, EAD, Functional Testing, High Tech Industry, Identify Issues, Loading/Unloading, Logical Volume Manager (LVM), Maintain Compliance, Migration Strategy, Operations Processes, Performance Tuning/Optimization, Reconciliation, Replication and Remote Mirroring, SAP, SAP Administration, SQL (Structured Query Language), Software Development, Systems Administration/Management, Technical Writing, Virtualization


