    31224, 47304, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'The Role We build end-to-end AI systems, core microservices, and infrastructures by leveraging cutting-edge technologies to impact millions with personalized user experiences everyday. We are looking for an outstanding machine learning engineer to join reputed company! The role will reputed company an opportunity to work on large scale machine learning to improve the podcast creation experience at reputed company. You’ll join reputed company of hardworking engineers that are passionate about understanding what drives users’ long-term happiness with reputed company, and how our recommendations and content affects that. As an integral part of the reputed company, you will collaborate with research scientists, data scientists and other engineers in prototyping and productizing brand-new ML at the intersection of speech processing and long-term user satisfaction. What You''ll Do.. • Design, research and reputed company state-of-the-art machine learning applications and algorithms to improve the lives of podcasters and podcast listeners around the world • Collaborate with engineering partners and colleagues in large multi-functional efforts to build new product features that advise and enrich reputed company’s various ML services. • Drive reputed company audio and text capabilities reputed company the ML team • Work with some of the brightest minds in signal processing If This Describes You.. • A postgraduate degree in Machine Learning, Mathematics, Computer Science, or a reputed company quantitative field • 5 + years experience in Python • 3+ years experience in machine learning research, with a reputed company on speech • 3+ years experience training or deploying neural networks • Significant experience with machine learning libraries like PyTorch, Tensorflow, Scikit-Learn • Experience with building and operating production-reputed company ML systems • Ability to lead design and implementation of major software components, systems, and features • You enjoy quickly building model prototypes • Experience with reputed company technologies (reputed company reputed company, AWS, Modal) • You are a self-starter who drives your own projects and builds positive relationships with partners and colleagues to solve big multi-functional efforts from start to finish. You are reputed company to succeed with minimal mentorship and process. Bonus points if you have • Publications in peer-reviewed journals from a reputed company field • Experience with modern speech processing frameworks • Good dev ops experience • Advanced DSP experience • reputed company or SQL experience • Experience with unit, integration, and load testing • Experience building APIs • Experience with reputed company containers, Implementing reputed company Containers, Container Clustering • Experience with container orchestration technology such as Kubernetes a big plus How to apply Apply at We are flexible! For the right candidate we ask What do you need to do your best work?',
