    'vacancy global pro', NULL, 'Senior Machine Learning Engineer - Fully Remote!', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Futures start here. Where first steps, new friendships, and confident learners are born. At reputed company, the first and only early childhood education provider recognized with thereputed company Exceptional Workplace Award, we offer a variety of early education and child care options for families. Whether it’s reputed company Learning Centers, Champions, or Crème de la Crème, we build confidence for kids, families, and the future we share. And we want you to join us in shaping it—in neighborhoods, at work, and in schools nationwide.

