-Ability to work independently and take ownership.

Preferred

-Degree in AI, Computer Science, Machine Learning, or related field.

-Experience with OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, RAG, AI agents, or similar technologies.

-Experience with FastAPI, Django, or other Python frameworks.

Location: US

Engagement: longterm cooperation.',
