    'Intrastack Technologies', NULL, 'Google Cloud & AI Engineer Interns | Intrastack Technologies | Handshake', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Remote Cloud & AI Engineer / Architect Intern
Company: Intrastack

Industry: Cloud & AI Consulting Services

Location: Remote

Target Group: Graduating Senior College Students

About Intrastack
Intrastack is an emerging startup specializing in next-generation cloud and AI consulting services. We empower businesses to modernize and scale by leveraging the power of Google Cloud Platform (GCP), modern database architectures, and cutting-edge Artificial Intelligence.

We are looking for driven, ambitious graduating seniors who want to fast-track their careers in cloud computing and AI engineering.

Program Overview
This is not a typical internship where you get coffee or do busywork. At Intrastack, you will undergo real, intensive, hands-on training designed to turn you into a production-ready Cloud and AI professional. Successful graduates of the internship program will have a direct pathway to join our Google Cloud Professional Services delivery practices.

What We Provide:
Instructor-Led Bootcamp Training: Interactive, real-time sessions led by industry experts.

Udemy Access: Full platform access to accelerate your technical skills.

Mastery in Modern Tech: Deep dives into Google Cloud Services, Databases, and AI solutions.

Career Growth: A direct pathway to full-time roles on our professional services team.

Responsibilities & Expectations
Actively participate in all bootcamp sessions and complete practical, hands-on labs.

Build deep technical expertise in Google Cloud architecture, database management, and AI services.

Mandate: Prepare for and pass required Google Cloud certifications during the program.

Demonstrate high dedication, accountability, and a drive to master complex engineering concepts.

Requirements & Eligibility
Academic Status: Current senior college student preparing for upcoming graduation.

Field of Study: Computer Science, Software Engineering, Information Technology, Data Science, or a related technical major.

Mindset: Highly motivated, serious, and ready for an intensive, fast-paced learning environment.

Work Authorization: Must be legally authorized to work without sponsorship. (Note: This position is not available for students requiring visa status/sponsorship at this time).

How to Apply
If you are a serious graduating senior ready to make a huge leap in your Cloud and AI career, we want to hear from you.

📧 Send your resume and a brief intro to: careers@intrastack.com

Subject Line: Cloud/AI Intern Application – [Your Name]',
