    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Hello, 

Hope you are doing great !!

 

Job Title: Android Developer – Banking Domain

Location: Phoenix, AZ / Plano, TX / Johnston, RI
Work Arrangement: Remote, but candidate must be local to one of the above locations

Job Description

We are looking for an experienced Android Developer with strong banking/financial services domain experience to develop, enhance, and maintain secure, scalable mobile banking applications. The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on Android coding experience and a solid understanding of banking applications, transactions, payments, and financial services.

Key Responsibilities

Design, develop, test, and maintain native Android applications using Kotlin and/or Java. Develop secure and scalable mobile applications for banking and financial services. Implement Android UI components, application workflows, APIs, and backend integrations. Integrate REST APIs, JSON, SDKs, and third-party services into Android applications. Work with banking features such as account management, transactions, payments, fund transfers, authentication, and notifications. Follow secure coding practices for applications handling financial and customer-sensitive data. Collaborate with product managers, business analysts, backend developers, QA engineers, and architects. Perform debugging, troubleshooting, unit testing, and performance optimization. Participate in code reviews, technical design discussions, and Agile/Scrum ceremonies. Ensure applications meet organizational security, quality, and compliance standards. Troubleshoot production issues and support application releases through the complete SDLC. Required Skills

Strong hands-on experience in Android application development. Excellent knowledge of Kotlin and/or Java. Strong understanding of Android SDK, Android Studio, Jetpack, and Android architecture. Experience with RESTful APIs, JSON, HTTP, Retrofit/OkHttp or similar technologies. Experience with MVVM/MVI/Clean Architecture and modern Android development. Strong understanding of Git, CI/CD, unit testing, and debugging. Experience developing mobile applications in the Banking/Financial Services domain. Understanding of banking processes such as: Retail Banking Digital Banking Payments Fund Transfers Account Management Cards/Credit Cards Authentication & Authorization Transaction Processing Strong understanding of mobile application security and protection of sensitive financial/customer information. 

Thanks & Regards 

 

Namit Raj Singh 

Amaze Systems Inc

Contact Details :- +1 (469) 250-1447 

Email :- 

USA: 8951 Cypress Waters Blvd, Suite 160, Dallas, TX 75019  



Amaze Systems is an Equal Opportunity Employer (EOE), and does not discriminate based on age, gender, religion, disability, marital status, race and also adheres to laws relating to non-discrimination on the basis of national origin and citizenship status.',
    'active', '2026-08-27T06:51:23.449489+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.dice.com/job-detail/eaa4ea04-52de-4b6d-b81b-d07557795a93', TRUE, ARRAY['Android Developer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
