    salary_min, salary_max, salary_currency, salary_period, description,
    status, posted_at, external_id, source, url, is_remote, tags
) VALUES (
    'Deloitte', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab376ba71577fc74338ef1c/images/aDdskaylaBh84lYDHrul9_L5SHeuENEBFba_fIeNGeg.jpeg', 'Mobile Application Developer Contractor', 'Remote', 'Contractor',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Position Summary

Contractor 

Onsite

Work you''ll do

Position Summary

We are seeking a Mobile Application Developer Contractor with 10+ years of Apple iOS development experience to support client-focused mobile application work. This role will develop, maintain, test, and enhance mobile applications that meet business needs and support consistent user experience. The contractor will also support integration with backend services and APIs.

Work you''ll doThe service you will provide the Deloitte project team as a Mobile Application Developer Contractor will include:



Develop and maintain Apple iOS mobile applications based on project requirementsWrite clean, maintainable code for mobile application features and updatesTest and debug mobile applications to support functionality and performanceImplement approved user interface designs for consistent user experienceIntegrate mobile applications with backend services and application programming interfaces (APIs)

Qualifications

Required:

10+ years of experience developing Apple iOS mobile applications10+ years of experience writing mobile application code productionExperience testing and debugging mobile applicationsExperience implementing mobile user interface designsExperience integrating mobile applications with backend services and APIs

Preferred

Experience maintaining existing iOS application codebasesExperience supporting mobile application performance improvementsExperience working on client-facing mobile application projects

The expected pay range for this contract assignment is $50 - $60 per hour.  The exact pay rate will vary based on skills, experience, and location and will be determined by the third-party whose employees provide services to Deloitte.

Candidates interested in applying for this opportunity must be geographically based in the United States and must be legally authorized to work in the United States without the need for employer sponsorship.

We do not accept agency resumes and are not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes.

Deloitte is not the employer for this role. 

This work is contracted through a third-party whose employees provide services to Deloitte.

Expected Work Schedule

Approximate hours per week

About Deloitte

Our inclusive culture empowers our people to be who they are, contribute their unique perspectives, and make a difference individually and collectively. It makes Deloitte one of the most rewarding places to work.

As used in this posting, “Deloitte” means , a subsidiary of Deloitte LLP. Please see www.deloitte.com/us/about for a detailed description of the legal structure of Deloitte LLP and its subsidiaries.

Requisition code: 365329',
    'active', '2026-09-04T06:51:23.449719+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/mobile-application-developer-contractor-at-deloitte-4463382388', TRUE, ARRAY['Android Developer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
