    'Nicolas Christcian', NULL, 'BOT development on Android Device is preferable / Windows', 'Remote', 'Contractor',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Need BOT development to do some jobs onbehalf of worker/human for specified (will be given later) web-site.
