4- If URL needs input3 , will get input3 data from remote DB again via API. 
5- Bot in application will proceed input3.
 6- if this 3-inputs is success: 
7- app. will get input4 and input5.
 8- Bot will proceed input4 and input5.
 9- Bot will get result and send datas to remote DB approximetely the app. will be included from these steps, may be 2 more or 2 less. will be depending/deciding on development period if needs.
 
More Detailed documents will be supplied during conversation.',
