    'Top Prospect Group', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab376bc03b136fb995abbf5/images/IntGhIcq-NrsZtEZnsaJ2awb76ixRPSfuHNlUdHpT_M.jpeg', 'Lead Mobile Software Engineer', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    130000, 200000, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Ready to shape the future of mobile technology? Join a high-impact engineering team where your React Native expertise, native mobile skills, and technical leadership will help build innovative products used across multiple platforms.




FT, Direct Hire

130-200K, plus benefits

Remote or Hybrid if you live near Westchester County, NY

