    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'QA Engineer

Role Type: Contractor

Location: Remote

About The Role

We are looking for experienced QA Engineers to support technical evaluation and AI training projects. You''ll apply your testing expertise to evaluate technical outputs, identify issues, and maintain high-quality standards.

Key Responsibilities



Design and execute functional, regression, and edge-case test cases.Perform manual and automated testing and document results.Identify, report, and track bugs with clear reproduction steps.Evaluate technical outputs against defined quality criteria.Provide detailed feedback and annotations.Collaborate with project teams to improve testing standards.


