) VALUES (
    'My3Tech Inc', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab376beae678c052c202525/images/LtHiVIrnx-NRV3Lc6PpJvayFu_YsAxoprhh6iUfhMQU.jpeg', 'QA Engineer Automated 3 - Remote', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'QA Engineer Automated 3 Location: Remote within TX 

Duration: 5 months contract with possibility to extension 

The client is seeking talented individuals to help revolutionize the way our Child Support Division manages workflows and delivers value. The ideal candidate will help with the development of software solutions for our Document Generation project by working new and existing testing efforts, investigating problem areas, conferring with users, and determining and designing system specifications, standards, and programming. This is an exciting opportunity to contribute to a project that will shape the future of our agency systems. 

Responsibilities:  Collaborate with software developers and cross-functional teams to understand application requirements and develop comprehensive test plans and strategies. Design and execute test cases, scripts, and procedures to thoroughly evaluate application functionality, performance, usability, and security. Conduct system and integration testing to identify defects, troubleshoot issues, and ensure seamless operation across various platforms. Document test results, track defects, and work closely with development teams to facilitate timely resolution and retesting. Participate in the design and implementation of manual and automated testing frameworks, tools, and processes to enhance efficiency and test coverage. Stay updated with industry best practices, emerging technologies, and testing methodologies, and actively contribute to continuous improvement initiatives. The job description and requirements are general in nature and may be subject to change based on the specific needs and requirements of the organization and project.  Candidate Skills and Qualifications: Years - Required/Preferred - Experience 

8 - Required - Proven experience in software testing, preferably within an application development environment. 

8 - Required - Strong knowledge of software testing principles, methodologies, and tools. 

8 - Required - Solid understanding of system architecture, databases, and operating systems. 

8 - Required - Proficiency in using testing tools, such as Selenium, VuGen, JUnit, or similar frameworks. 

8 - Required - Excellent problem-solving skills, with a meticulous attention to detail. 

8 - Required - Strong communication and collaboration abilities, with the capacity to work effectively in cross-functional teams. 

8 - Required - Self-motivated and capable of managing multiple tasks and priorities in a fast-paced environment. 

5 - Required - Experience with Agile development methodologies 

4 - Preferred - Bachelor''s degree in computer science, software engineering, or a related field. 

4 - Preferred - Relevant work experience conducting performance testing. 

1 - Preferred - Familiarity with Salesforce platform and Conga Composer.',
    'active', '2026-09-23T06:51:23.450310+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://lensa.com/job-v1/my3tech-inc/remote/qa-engineer/31441ffc7f7d4ff5260a53c479fa363f', TRUE, ARRAY['Qa Engineer','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
