    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'AuraOne is seeking a Mobile Game Developer to remotely review production code, debug traces, and model outputs against correctness standards. You will reproduce failures, write unit tests, and explain fixes so the modeling team can target gaps.This is a contractor role with remote US eligibility. Responsibilities include grading solutions for correctness, explaining reasoning to senior engineers, and documenting recurring failure modes to improve future reviews.#J-18808-Ljbffr',
