) VALUES (
    'Dexcom', 'data:image/png;base64,', 'Product Manager, Consumer Mobile App', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    122000, 204000, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Meet the team: 

Join our dynamic and innovative consumer team at the crux of innovation, technology, and consumer products! We are dedicated to empowering individuals to take control of their metabolic health through cutting-edge biosensor technology and intuitive app experiences. If you''re passionate about pushing the boundaries of what''s possible and thrive in fast-moving environments, we want you on our team.

As Product Manager for the Stelo app, you''ll lead the development of in-app features that help users monitor, understand, and improve their metabolic health. You''ll work cross-functionally with design, engineering, clinical, and marketing teams to deliver experiences that are evidence-based, engaging, and impactful.

Where you come in: 
Continuously discover and prioritize opportunities that will drive our product and business outcomesTranslate user needs, clinical insights, and business goals into clear product requirementsCollaborate with UX/UI designers to craft intuitive and motivating user experiencesPartner with engineering to prioritize and deliver high-quality mobile featuresMonitor product performance, user feedback, and health outcomes to iterate and improveContribute to the product strategy and roadmap for the Stelo app, and take ownership of driving execution from concept to launch.Stay current on trends in metabolic health, digital therapeutics, and mobile health innovation

What makes you successful: 
3+ years of product management experience for a mobile app, ideally in digital health or wellnessStrong understanding of, and passion for metabolic healthProven success building and launching mobile apps (iOS/Android)Experience with wearable tech, CGM, and/or health data platformsFamiliarity with regulatory considerations in consumer health appsExperience working with cross-functional teams in agile environmentsExcellent communication, prioritization, and stakeholder management skillsPassion for empowering people to live healthier lives through technology

What you''ll get: 
A front row seat to life changing CGM technology. Learn about our brave #dexcomwarriors community. A full and comprehensive benefits program.Growth opportunities on a global scale.Access to career development through in-house learning programs and/or qualified tuition reimbursement.An exciting and innovative, industry-leading organization committed to our employees, customers, and the communities we serve.

Travel Required: 
5-15%

Experience and Education Requirements:
Typically requires a Bachelor''s degree and a minimum of 8-12 years of related experience.At this level a graduate degree may be desirable with 4 years of related experience.

Remote Workplace: Your location will be a home office; you are not required to live within commuting distance of your assigned Dexcom site (typically 75 miles/120km). If you reside within commuting distance of a Dexcom site (typically 75 miles/120km) a hybrid working environment may be available. Ask about our Flex workplace option.

Please note: The information contained herein is not intended to be an all-inclusive list of the duties and responsibilities of the job, nor are they intended to be an all-inclusive list of the skills and abilities required to do the job. Management may, at its discretion, assign or reassign duties and responsibilities to this job at any time. The duties and responsibilities in this job description may be subject to change at any time due to reasonable accommodation or other reasons. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform essential functions. 

Salary:
$122,500.00 - $204,100.00

#DexcomUS',
    'active', '2026-09-19T06:51:23.452262+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.theladders.com/job/product-manager-consumer-mobile-app-dexcom-virtual-travel_88918325', TRUE, ARRAY['Product Manager','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
