    'Growe Talents', 'https://serpapi.com/searches/6ab376dfbe918a1b1b57b580/images/3kagyTIAdrhnoCIQQgX94qxQC5IFoTN3Nfq_InAH0ZM.jpeg', 'Payment Product Manager', 'Remote', 'Full-time',
    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'Job Description:

 Make system behavior explicit, including callback timeouts, withdrawal hold and release rules, gateway configuration setups, and player-facing error messages Drive and optimize the seven core back-office operational screens: projects, gateways, payment groups, methods, orders, transactions, and logs Lead timeboxed discovery spikes across eleven internal systems, including player accounts, wallet, KYC, fraud checks, reconciliation, and taxation Define regional migration rollout stages, validation rules, progression criteria, and rollback plans Maintain alignment and communication with local operations, support, and business owners about changes, risks, and contingency plans Establish post-launch processes for incident management, configuration changes, new payment method onboarding, and ongoing integration healthRequirements:

 4+ years of product management experience, with at least 2 years in payments, fintech, or complex transactional systems, holding ownership over a product area rather than just managing a backlog Ability to read API contracts and follow a transaction across multiple systems independently Proven track record of writing clear requirements, with explicit outcomes, clear acceptance criteria, and well-defined boundaries Data-driven approach to product decisions, working comfortably with conversion, approval rates, failure reasons, and cost per transaction to separate signal from noise At least Intermediate level of English for all documentation, ticketing, and daily cross-team communication Comfort operating in ambiguity, with a knack for designing the smallest possible experiment to remove doubt when answers do not yet exist Strong sense of ownership and transparent communication, with the drive to inform affected regions early and plainly whenever something goes wrong Problem-solving skills focused on reducing complexity, closing unknowns early, and preventing rework before development startsBenefits:

 Health & Wellness Focus Global Medical Coverage Growth Opportunities Benefits Programs (compensation for the gym/stomatology/psychological service & etc.) Performance-Driven Rewards Dynamic Work Environment',
    'active', '2026-09-08T06:51:23.452750+00:00', '', 'google_jobs', 'https://www.remoterocketship.com/us/company/growe-talents/jobs/payment-product-manager-united-states-remote/', TRUE, ARRAY['Product Manager','Remote']::TEXT[]
)
