    NULL, NULL, 'USD', 'Yearly', 'A rapidly growing digital consulting organization is seeking a Manager of Artificial Intelligence to lead enterprise AI initiatives and help clients turn data into business value. This full-time opportunity offers the chance to work with cutting-edge technologies including Generative AI, Large Language Models (LLMs), Databricks, Python, MLOps, and cloud-based machine learning platforms while partnering with some of the most sophisticated B2B organizations in the market.

