Required Skills & Experience



6+ years of AI, Machine Learning, Data Science, or AI Engineering experience Prior leadership experience managing technical teams Strong experience with Python and SQL Hands-on experience with Generative AI and LLMs Experience deploying machine learning solutions into production Databricks experience including MLflow and model deployment Strong communication and client-facing skills Experience designing scalable AI architectures 

Desired Skills & Experience

R programming experience Azure ML, AWS SageMaker, or GCP Vertex AI LangChain, AutoGen, CrewAI, or similar frameworks Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) Prompt Engineering Digital consulting or agency experience Enterprise-scale MLOps experience 

What You Will Be Doing

Tech Breakdown

35% Generative AI / LLM Development 25% Databricks & Data Engineering 20% MLOps & Production Deployment 20% Cloud AI Platforms & Architecture 

Daily Responsibilities

50% Hands-On Technical Leadership 25% Team Management & Mentorship 25% Client Interaction & Strategic Consulting 

The Offer

Competitive hourly rate 

You Will Receive The Following Benefits

Medical, Dental, and Vision Insurance Career Development Opportunities 

Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the US on a full-time basis now and in the future.

